To the data protection officer of {empresa}:

My name is {nombre}, and I am writing to exercise my right to erasure under {articulo} ({ley}).

I ask you to:
1. Delete all the personal data you hold about me and stop processing it, including for advertising, profiling or sale to third parties.
2. If you have shared or sold it to other companies, tell me which ones and pass this request on to them.
3. Confirm to me in writing that you have done so, within the deadline the law sets: {plazo}.

You can reply to this email address: {correo}. If you need any further detail to find me in your systems, let me know; I am not sending you more than necessary.
{evidencia}
{fecha}

{nombre}

